  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteItem
  noteTitle: A Rusty Gas Mask
  noteBody: "The gas mask looks like it has been worn before. There must be a reason
    why there's a mask in a hospital like this. Is it for the gas experiments so
    that the staff can be safe? \n\nWhat if I am the one being influenced by this
    gas?"
